        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Tourist opens the details of a priced public tour. A1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system shows the price, a preview of the first place and the &quot;Buy tour&quot; button." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Tourist taps &quot;Buy tour&quot;. E1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="320" x="-160" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system shows the &quot;Confirm tour purchase&quot; dialog (tour name, price, payment through VNPay)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="220" x="-110" y="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The Tourist taps &quot;Pay&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The system (Payment) checks the tour, price and purchase eligibility; creates a pending order (expires in 15 minutes) and returns a signed VNPay URL. E2, E3, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The client sends the Tourist to the VNPay page." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="1035" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. The Tourist pays on the VNPay page. A2, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="320" x="-160" y="1155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. VNPay calls the IPN; the system checks the signature, order code and amount, marks the order paid and publishes payment.completed; Tour records the access. E6, E7." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="1325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="10. The result page shows &quot;Payment successful. You can now listen to this tour.&quot; and a &quot;Start listening&quot; button. E8." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="1560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="11. Notification stores an in-app notification and sends a receipt email." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1765" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
